# AGENTS.md

---

## Runtime Context

- Read `@CLINE.md` for Cline-specific tool mappings, rules, and model guidance.


---

## On Start

- Glob `**/artefacts/README.md` and read all matches. 
- Run `git log --oneline -5`.
- Read `@context/agents/orchestrator.md`.
- Determine workflow: 1) from the prompt; 2) if not in prompt, read the `Workflow:` field in `artefacts/build/HANDOFF.md` if it exists; 3) if no HANDOFF.md exists, ask the user which workflow to start.
- Load `@context/workflows/<workflow>.yaml`. 


---

## Project Context

- Read `@artefacts/build/tasks-{branch}.md` if it exists for the task list